WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:01:06.191 --> 00:01:07.567
It's delicious!

00:01:08.109 --> 00:01:10.862
I didn't know you had such talent,
Kiiroitori.

00:01:14.032 --> 00:01:17.243
And... I still don't know who this is.

00:01:24.959 --> 00:01:28.880
I'M RILAKKUMA

00:01:30.715 --> 00:01:32.383
You really are huge.

00:01:34.385 --> 00:01:39.641
A FEW MONTHS LATER

00:01:42.936 --> 00:01:47.982
And so, Rilakkuma has settled in my place.

00:01:51.653 --> 00:01:52.737
Not only that...

00:01:55.490 --> 00:01:56.783
I'm back.

00:02:05.959 --> 00:02:08.920
I'M KORILAKKUMA

00:02:14.759 --> 00:02:16.344
You're kind of cute.

00:02:22.934 --> 00:02:25.645
I wished for a cat

00:02:26.771 --> 00:02:29.607
who would make me feel better
when I stroked its fluffy fur.

00:02:29.649 --> 00:02:32.193
A cat who would wait for me to come home.

00:02:33.444 --> 00:02:37.282
A cat, not a bear.

